---
// Frequently Asked Questions in clean Rebus style (no emojis, no pills)
---

<section id="faq" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-[#e5e0d4] bg-[#fbf9f5]">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5c5b56] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">
        FAQ // Questions & Answers
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#141413]">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="group bg-white border-2 border-[#141413] p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer rebus-stamp-shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-[#141413] uppercase tracking-tight">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5c5b56]">01.</span>
            <span>Is this really free to use?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#141413] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5c5b56] mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5e0d4] leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Yes. There are no subscriptions, credits, or hidden fees. Generate as much speech as you like.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="group bg-white border-2 border-[#141413] p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer rebus-stamp-shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-[#141413] uppercase tracking-tight">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5c5b56]">02.</span>
            <span>Is my data kept private?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#141413] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5c5b56] mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5e0d4] leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Yes. Your text, voice recordings, and generated speech files are never stored, saved, or shared with anyone.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="group bg-white border-2 border-[#141413] p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer rebus-stamp-shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-[#141413] uppercase tracking-tight">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5c5b56]">03.</span>
            <span>Can I download the audio file?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#141413] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5c5b56] mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5e0d4] leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Yes. As soon as your audio is generated, click the Download Audio button to save it instantly to your device.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details class="group bg-white border-2 border-[#141413] p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer rebus-stamp-shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-[#141413] uppercase tracking-tight">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5c5b56]">04.</span>
            <span>How does voice cloning work?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#141413] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5c5b56] mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5e0d4] leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Record or upload a 5 to 15 second audio sample. Speak clearly into the microphone in a quiet room for the best results.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <details class="group bg-white border-2 border-[#141413] p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer rebus-stamp-shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-[#141413] uppercase tracking-tight">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5c5b56]">05.</span>
            <span>What are the rules for cloning a voice?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#141413] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5c5b56] mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5e0d4] leading-relaxed font-medium">
          You must have clear permission from the speaker to clone their voice. Impersonating individuals or generating deceptive audio is prohibited.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
